        "created_at": "2014-02-09T18:22:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope, they were a limited time thing. Mostly it was the boxes left over from selling /just/ the sets of IR or RC that people may have been missing, and they wont be breaking up sets again in the future.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>http://go7gaming.com/ has some great inserts, the&nbsp;http://go7gaming.com/asb-001-insert/ works with the HobbyLobby case some forumgoers have already made into a custom box for themselves - ive got one on order. Stuff should be open for general order soon, as the kickstarter ended last month and orders are supposed to start going out in March.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
